        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "This makes sense, but I wonder if it would be better to wait to inform the program until after the synchronized update ends.\r\n\r\n> @noib3 was in this area\r\n\r\nI worked on https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40086, which seems unrelated to this.",
